ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279128044,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkxMjgwNDQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/confirmed","name":"confirmed","color":"aaddaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","color":"ffddff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","number":24,"title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-05-03T00:09:48Z","updated_at":"2026-05-21T21:17:58Z","closed_at":"2026-05-21T21:17:58Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in:\n- Godot v4.7.beta1.official [1c8cc9e7e]\n\nControl test:\n- Replacing the AreaLight3D with an OmniLight3D in the same scene produces correct shadows.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta1.mono - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT Wed, 29 Apr 2026 18:46:30 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080 (nvidia; 595.71.05) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700K (28 threads) - 62.51 GiB memory - PulseAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nAreaLight3D with shadows enabled produces severe shadow artifacts/leaks in a very simple setup.\n\nThe scene contains only:\n- one AreaLight3D with shadows enabled\n- one thick box/wall as occluder\n- one wall/floor as shadow receiver\n\nThe shadow on the receiver is visibly broken/smeared/leaking. Replacing the AreaLight3D with an OmniLight3D in the same scene produces a correct shadow, so the issue appears specific to AreaLight3D shadows.\n\nExpected behavior:\nThe occluder should block the light and produce a continuous shadow on the receiver.\n\nActual behavior:\nThe AreaLight3D shadow breaks into a smeared/incorrect artifact on the receiver.\n\nAreaLight3D result:\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7259dac-a732-4874-95f4-77fc2a19bcce\" />  \n\nOmniLight3D control result:  \n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/092f900c-8124-421e-a38e-86d513a1fbbf\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a new 3D scene.\n2. Set the renderer to Forward+.\n3. Add an AreaLight3D and enable shadows.\n4. Add a thick BoxMesh wall/box as occluder.\n5. Add a BoxMesh wall/floor as shadow receiver.\n6. Observe the broken/smeared shadow artifact on the receiver.\n7. Replace the AreaLight3D with an OmniLight3D in the same scene.\n8. Observe that the shadow is rendered correctly with OmniLight3D.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAttached ZIP contains a minimal reproduction project.\n\nContents:\n- `area_light_broken.tscn`: AreaLight3D with shadows enabled, showing the broken/smeared shadow artifact.\n- `omni_light_control.tscn`: Same setup using OmniLight3D, showing the expected correct shadow.\n\nThe `.godot` folder is not included.\n\n[area_light_shadow_repro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27310058/area_light_shadow_repro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"mhilbrunner","id":1654763,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTQ3NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1654763?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner","html_url":"https://github.com/mhilbrunner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mhilbrunner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/